{
  "name": "Weekly B2B buying signals: companies hiring for a tech stack to Google Sheets (Apify)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly sales prospect list from job postings\n\nEvery Monday this workflow asks the **Companies Hiring by Tech Stack** Actor on Apify which companies opened roles mentioning the tools you sell into (e.g. Snowflake, Salesforce, HubSpot) and appends them to a Google Sheet: company, website, new roles, open roles, growth, top teams and countries.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Free Apify account: https://apify.com/worthwhile_quinsy/companies-hiring-by-tech-stack\n2. In *Find companies hiring*, create a **Header Auth** credential (Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer <your Apify API token>`) and edit `technologies`.\n3. In *Append to sheet*, connect Google Sheets and pick a spreadsheet with a header row: company, company_website, new_jobs, open_jobs, open_jobs_30_days_ago, top_departments, hiring_countries, new_job_titles.\n\nCost: about $0.03 per company row.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "5168053e-670a-4f62-bb4b-70bfc815849e",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "194253ee-7fe7-4b87-8703-e2ab7b7412d8",
      "name": "Every Monday",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/worthwhile_quinsy~companies-hiring-by-tech-stack/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"technologies\": [\n    \"Snowflake\",\n    \"dbt\"\n  ],\n  \"newWithinDays\": 7,\n  \"maxResults\": 50\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "b169b677-b8ef-420b-a210-263e2b0e2806",
      "name": "Find companies hiring",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "bd271b09-b7c0-4f75-9a13-d796625f0c8e",
              "name": "top_departments",
              "value": "={{ ($json.top_departments || []).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1450fe53-ac67-4f98-b21e-acdbfa847a75",
              "name": "hiring_countries",
              "value": "={{ ($json.hiring_countries || []).join(', ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "186ea633-0bce-42fe-b6cd-dfd9863b788c",
              "name": "new_job_titles",
              "value": "={{ ($json.new_job_titles || []).slice(0, 5).join(' | ') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "690dadfb-a5c7-480f-a67e-df748dfdc1c1",
      "name": "Flatten lists",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e22edd7d-3dad-480e-838d-36f93d2c503d",
      "name": "Append to sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        720,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Apify credential\nHeader Auth credential:\n- Name: `Authorization`\n- Value: `Bearer <your Apify API token>`\n\nThe Actor returns its rows directly (run-sync-get-dataset-items), so the next node gets one item per row.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 260
      },
      "id": "4dab7cbb-b62a-4ca6-955a-f73b1e1b9af9",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        380
      ]
    }
  ],
